Implement Dashboard Search, Filters, and View Controls
1. Introduction

   To improve the usability and accessibility of the Employee Analytics Dashboard, advanced dashboard controls were implemented. These enhancements allow users to efficiently search employee records, filter dashboard data, switch between different viewing modes, and export analytics information. The implementation focuses on providing a more interactive and user-friendly dashboard experience.

2. Objective

   The primary objective of this implementation was to improve dashboard navigation and data accessibility by introducing search functionality, filtering options, view controls, and export capabilities.

3. Dashboard Search

   A search component was introduced to enable quick employee lookup within the dashboard.

   Implemented
   Employee search input
   Dynamic employee filtering
   Search by employee name
   Instant search response
   Improved search usability
   Outcome

   Users can quickly locate employees without manually browsing through the dashboard.

4. Department Filter

   A department filter was implemented to display employees belonging to a selected department.

   Implemented
   Department dropdown
   Dynamic department selection
   Employee filtering based on department
   Default "All Departments" option
   Outcome

   Managers can easily analyze employee information within specific departments.

5. Project Filter

   A project filter was introduced to allow users to view employees associated with a particular project.

   Implemented
   Project dropdown
   Project-wise employee filtering
   Dynamic project selection
   Integration with dashboard analytics
   Outcome

   Users can quickly monitor employee performance across different projects.

6. Date Range Filter

   A date range selector was implemented to filter dashboard analytics based on a selected reporting period.

   Available Options
   Today
   This Week
   This Month
   Implemented
   Date range dropdown
   Dynamic data filtering
   Dashboard refresh based on selected period
   Outcome

   Users can analyze employee statistics for different time periods.

7. Export Functionality

   An export option was added to support downloading employee analytics data.

   Implemented
   Export action
   Dashboard export entry point
   Prepared export structure for future enhancements
   Outcome

   Provides a foundation for exporting analytics reports in future development phases.

8. View Controls

   View controls were introduced to improve the way employee information is presented.

   Implemented
   Grid View
   List View
   View switch controls
   Dynamic layout switching
   Outcome

   Users can choose the most convenient visualization based on their preference.

